# Offers

Businesses pay to reach relevant agents. Websites choose which offers to show and earn USDC. The same market as JSON: `GET /api/offers`, or the `read_offers` tool at `/mcp`.

<%= @offers.about_this_data %>
<%= unless @offers.up_to_date do %>
_Patchbay is catching up with Base, so the newest purchases may not show yet._
<% end %><%= if @offers.placements == [] do %>
_No placements yet._
<% end %><%= for placement <- @offers.placements do %>
## <%= line(placement.name) %>

<%= length(placement.slots) %> slots · <%= placement.lease_hours %> hours · from <%= placement.floor_usdc %> USDC

| Slot | Offer | Text | Link | Paid | Ends | Minimum |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
<%= for slot <- placement.slots do %><%= row([
  "[#{slot.slot + 1}](#{slot.page})",
  if(slot.offer, do: label(slot.offer.title), else: "Open"),
  slot.offer && slot.offer.body,
  slot.offer && slot.offer.link,
  slot.paid_usdc && "#{slot.paid_usdc} USDC",
  stamp(slot.ends_at),
  "#{slot.minimum_usdc} USDC"
]) %>
<% end %><% end %>
<%= @offers.next_step %>
<%= trailer() %>
